{"unit_id":"tag:025O:proof","translation":"由<MATH_0001>的忠实（faithful）平坦性（flatness）显然可知，如果<MATH_0002>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0003>亦然。另见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。反过来，假设<MATH_0004>约化（reduced）。由假设，<MATH_0005>为一个局部化（localization），所取的是有限型（finite type）<MATH_0006>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0007>在某个素理想（prime）<MATH_0008>处。将<MATH_0009>替换为一个局部化（localization）后，可以假设<MATH_0010>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0011>之上，见引理<REF_0002>。于是《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>适用于<MATH_0012>，从而<MATH_0013>约化（reduced）。因此<MATH_0014>约化（reduced）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实","context":"开头平坦性的限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"用于下降约化性的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"四次实际出现的约化性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"原局部环的表示及随后替换；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"用来表示局部环的代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所选择的有限型代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想","context":"局部化的位置；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"替换后代数在底环上的性质；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:039U:statement","translation":"关于“约化性（reducedness）”的结论，对于较弱定义下的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部环（local ring）映射（maps）<MATH_0001>并不成立；这里删去的假设是<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上本质有限型（essentially of finite type）。具体地，可能有诺特局部整环（Noetherian local domain）<MATH_0004>，具有非约化（nonreduced）的完备化（completion）<MATH_0005>，见《例子》第<REF_0001>节。然而环映射（ring map）<MATH_0006>平坦（flat），且<MATH_0007>为极大（maximal）理想（ideal），属于<MATH_0008>；而<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>当然具有相同的剩余域（residue fields）。所以，重要的是只对环（ring）扩张（extensions）考虑此概念，并要求本质有限型（essentially of finite type）（或者本质上（essentially）有限表示（finite presentation），当<MATH_0011>不是诺特（Noetherian）时）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型"},{"source_term":"Noetherian local domain","target_term":"诺特局部整环"},{"source_term":"nonreduced","target_term":"非约化"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型"},{"source_term":"essentially","target_term":"本质上"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性","context":"所讨论的保持性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"被削弱的定义；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环","context":"被削弱定义的映射的对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"开头提及的局部环映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型","context":"两次指出的必要有