{"unit_id":"tag:025P:proof","translation":"关于下降（descending）正规性（normality），见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。反过来，假设<MATH_0001>正规（normal）。由假设，<MATH_0002>为一个局部化（localization），所取的是有限型（finite type）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0004>在某个素理想（prime）<MATH_0005>处。将<MATH_0006>替换为一个局部化（localization）后，可以假设<MATH_0007>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0008>之上，见引理<REF_0002>。于是《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>适用于<MATH_0009>，从而<MATH_0010>正规（normal）。所以<MATH_0011>为正规（normal）整环（domain）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"normality","target_term":"正规性"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"domain","target_term":"整环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降","context":"开头对正规性进行的数学下降操作；保留实际词形，译名待决。"},{"source_term":"normality","target_term":"正规性","context":"所下降的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规","context":"三次实际出现的环的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"局部环的表示及随后的替换；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"用来表示给定局部环的代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所选的有限型代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想","context":"局部化的位置；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"替换后代数的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"domain","target_term":"整环","context":"最后结论中的环类型；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025L:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n前面的命题在一定程度上说明，为何希望将平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）映射（maps）视作“局部（local）同构（isomorphisms）”。还有一个性质很好地表明我们得到了“正确”的定义：对于<MATH_0001>-概形（schemes），其为有限型（finite type），一个态射（morphism）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale），当且仅当相应的态射（morphism），位于解析空间（analytic spaces）之间（也就是赋予复（complex）拓扑（topology）的<MATH_0002>-值（valued）点（points）），在解析（analytic）意义下是局部（local）同构（isomorphism）（即在源（source）上局部地（locally）为开嵌入（open embedding））。这个事实可借助结构定理及以下事实证明：解析化（analytification）与完备（completed）局部环（local rings）的构造可交换（commutes）。细节留给读者。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"analytic spaces","target_term":"解析空间"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"valued","target_term":"值"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"analytic","target_term":"解析"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源"},{"source_term":"locally","target_term":"局部地"},{"source_term":"open embedding","target_term":"开嵌入"},{"source_term":"analytification","target_term":"解析化"},{"source_term":"completed","target_term":"完备"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"所刻画的代数性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"首句的几何映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"开头及解析意义下的同构限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","cont